Look for the line 
  if (remember_discover) discover = remember_discover;
Add after this something like
  if (discover && yn("Keep non-scoring discovery mode?")!='y'){
    pline("Discovery mode removed.");
    discover = FALSE;
  }
After reloading, you can remove your explore mode flag. Use with care.

